  "abstract": "This experiment re-runs the optimal Learnable Gamma Minimal Factorized MLP configuration (Lumina I's ID 455) with an enhanced `export_stats` function to extract and save the learned `gamma` profiles. This is part of a new research project, 'Horizon Gating Mechanics & Optimization,' aiming to mechanistically understand horizon gating's architectural dependencies by analyzing its learned behavior across different models.",
